I am at the office.
I am working on my laptop.
Then Priya comes to my desk.
She is a designer on our project.
She smiles and says, "Hello Maya."
I say, "Hello Priya."
"How are you?"
Priya says, "I am well."
"Do you have time on Saturday?"
I think to myself that I am not busy.
I say, "Yes, I have time on Saturday."
Priya says, "Great!"
"Then come to my house on Saturday night."
"Let's eat dinner together."
"I will make special Maharashtrian food."
I am very happy.
I like Maharashtrian food a lot.
I say, "Thank you, Priya!"
"I will definitely come."
She goes back to her desk.
I think to myself that it will be a good evening.
